    "detailed_description": "Idle Progress - A free idle game where your task is to produce as many resources as possible, improve your weapons and armor for good attacks, create good fishing rods for a good catch and get legendary stuff by completing legendary quests.<br><br>You can either just farm by upgrading your production or equip a weapon and armor to start fighting for better resources, better crafts and to earn the <strong>LEGENDARY ITEMS!</strong><br><br>- Over 4 epic legendary quests to complete<br>- Build infrastructure with resources to increase population <br>- Try your self at science to create interesting creatures<br>- Increase your Game Skill by selling/crafting/melting stuff<br>- Spend some time unboxing treasures to get cool rare items<br>- Or you can simply relax while you are fishing",
